{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/extras/a5a9fd25c47dd40f406aae4efefe22d9.avif?t=1763325190\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Streaming is easier than a 9-5&quot; they say?! IF ONLY THEY KNEW the things we must do to make sure we don't get caught by security and everything else that might hold us back from becoming THE BEST STREAMER. Type 1 in the chat if you're ready to see us take over this whole industry.&quot;1&quot; &quot;1&quot; &quot;1&quot; &quot;1&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a streamer, you need to go big or go home. Creating a successful stream won't be easy and you need to put in that work! Your goal is to go through seven different levels and create the best stream you can! It won't be easy though!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/extras/ae742ea02099aedb81d54f24719006c8.avif?t=1763325190\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >.....who could be watching?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With so many people watching, you gotta put on a show! You might even get some viewers to subscribe to your channel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/extras/8d863c89e373d063e4d0f977a59f139e.avif?t=1763325190\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who needs a job when you're making bank?!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the money you made from your stream to buy character upgrades and gifts, so that your stream can be even better!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/extras/3fc0657ad19643dfff0fa87f32823ecd.avif?t=1763325190\" width=1000 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat that reacts to everything you do</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different dialogue choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully voice acted cut-scenes and NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different endings for how you interact with the NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 different maps to explore for your stream</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character upgrades with the money you make from stream</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies that will hunt you down</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3838100?t=1763325190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/f05c1df38fb125fe34d39f677186b79001162c76/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763325190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/cd39d184d599448d95a0893c7a9f51507a442e89/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763325190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838100/cd39d184d599448d95a0893c7a9f51507a442e89/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763325190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4136700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it